#. translators: %1$s: example of embedding a file, %2$s: details of key used in
#. example
#: includes/options-screen.php:131
msgid "To embed an external URL you would type %1$s, where %2$s is the URL."
msgstr "To embed an external URL you would type %1$s, where %2$s is the URL."

#. translators: %1$s: example embedding for responsive layout , %2$s: details
#. of key used in example
#: includes/options-screen.php:128
msgid "To embed the same code but to make it responsive you would use %1$s. To set a maximum width you would use %2$s, where %3$s is the maximum width in pixels."
msgstr "To embed the same code but to make it responsive you would use %1$s. To set a maximum width you would use %2$s, where %3$s is the maximum width in pixels."

#. translators: %1$s: example of how to embed code in a post based on current
#. settings, %2$s: details of key used in example
#: includes/options-screen.php:123
msgid "Then, to add the code into your post simply add %1$s where you wish it to appear. %2$s is the suffix you used for the custom field name."
msgstr "Then, to add the code into your post simply add %1$s where you wish it to appear. %2$s is the suffix you used for the custom field name."

#. translators: %1$s: example of custom field key value to use based on current
#. settings, %2$s: details of key used in example
#: includes/options-screen.php:120
msgid "Based upon your current settings to embed some code simply add a custom field named %1$s, where %2$s is any suffix you wish. The code to embed is then added as the field value."
msgstr "Based upon your current settings to embed some code simply add a custom field named %1$s, where %2$s is any suffix you wish. The code to embed is then added as the field value."

#: includes/options-screen.php:117
msgid "How To Embed"
msgstr "How To Embed"

#: includes/options-screen.php:102
