#: includes/screens.php:144
msgid "The search results are grouped together in matching code groups, so posts with the same code will be shown together with the same color background."
msgstr "The search results are grouped together in matching code groups, so posts with the same code will be shown together with the same colour background."

#: includes/screens.php:143
msgid "Simply enter the code suffix that you wish to search for and press the 'Search' button to display a list of all the posts using it. In addition, the code will be shown alongside it. Click on the post name to edit the post."
msgstr "Simply enter the code suffix that you wish to search for and press the 'Search' button to display a list of all the posts using it. In addition, the code will be shown alongside it. Click on the post name to edit the post."

#: includes/screens.php:142
msgid "This screen allows you to search for posts and pages that a particular code embed has been used in."
msgstr "This screen allows you to search for posts and pages that a particular code embed has been used in."

#: includes/screens.php:128
msgid "The keyword, sandwiched with the identifier before and after, is what you then need to add to your post or page to activate the embed code."
msgstr "The keyword, sandwiched with the identifier before and after, is what you then need to add to your post or page to activate the embed code."

#: includes/screens.php:127
msgid "The keyword is the name used for your custom field. The custom field's value is the code that you wish to embed."
msgstr "The keyword is the name used for your custom field. The custom field's value is the code that you wish to embed."

#: includes/screens.php:125
msgid "Use this screen to modify the various settings, including the identifiers and keyword used to specify your embedded code."
msgstr "Use this screen to modify the various settings, including the identifiers and keyword used to specify your embedded code."

